        <summary>Called when sample data is found in the stream.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Called when sample data is found in the stream. If the invocation of this method returns before the entire inputReader length is consumed, the method will be called again for the implementer to read the remaining data. Implementers should surface any thrown IOException caused by reading from input.</para>
